{{PageBanner|Eve l 050 5 en.png|event}}
'''Cats Abloom!''' (イースターイベント, ''Īsutā Ibento'', '''Easter Event''') is the Easter event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]], and later recieved more stages in Versions [[Version 10.3 Update|10.3]], [[Version 12.2 Update|12.2]] and [[Version 15.2 Update|15.2]].

==Event Information==
Embark on a quest to uncover the mysteries of Easter!

On from April 27th (11:00am) until May 11th (10:59am)!

● Limited Easter Capsules!<br>
Vibrant spring capsules are here for a limited time!<br>
Plus, {{Color|#9900FF|'''new Talents'''}} for {{Color|#9900FF|'''Springtime Kenshin'''}}{{Color|#8E7CC3|'''!'''}}<br>
Tap the banner in the Rare Capsules to check the available lineup of characters and their abilities!


※ The characters above appear at a fixed rate from draws made on this set during this event, alongside regularly available Rare and Super Rare heroes.

● Limited Springtime Stages!<br>
Spring stages are available only during this event,<br>
with rewards reset for certain stages!

The stages can be accessed from the Legend Stages section of the menu. "Go to the Start!!" section and check for the limited stages below!

・Special Stage: "Spring Sprang Sprung"<br>
Conquer these special stages and you'll be rewarded with a chance to pick up Eggy Cat!

Reward(s): Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket etc.

※ Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance of unlocking this character.<br>
※ This character cannot be unlocked again if earned from a previous event.<br>
※ Activate your new unit in the Upgrade menu after receiving it.<br>
※ Tap the Timed Score button at the bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

・Special Stage: "Eggy Cat Awakens!"<br>
Challenge this tough stage to earn a chance to unlock Eggy Cat's True Form!

Reward(s): XP

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Eggy Cat can be collected from the stage Spring Sprang Sprung.

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Eggy Cat will need to be at level 20 to unlock its True Form.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Eggy Cat can still be evolved to its True Form even if the character has not yet been collected.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Check available rewards and point requirements by tapping Timed Score at the bottom left of the map screen!


・Gauntlet Map: "Suffering Spring!"<br>
Terrifying enemies gather for an Easter carnival?!?!

Reward(s): Behemoth Stone (Purple, Red, Blue, Green, Yellow), Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, etc.

<nowiki>*</nowiki> This stage will appear after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 1.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Once all stage attempts have been used, you will be able to retry after a certain amount of time has passed.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Using a Catamin A will immediately grant another stage attempt.

・New Map: "Discover Easter's Wonders!", from day 8!<br>
Uncover the mysteries of Easter Island!

On from May 4th (11:00am) until May 11th (10:59am)!

Reward(s): Catseye (Rare, Super Rare, Uber Rare, Legend)

<nowiki>*</nowiki> This stage will appear after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 1, and is accessible after reaching User Rank 1600 or above.

